window.products.push({"id":882084,"name":"Biddy Murphy Wall Mounted Bottle Opener Brass Slainte Claddagh Symbol Irish Barware Home Décor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31DJOjMDKyL._AC_.jpg","description":"Since the early 1700s, the Claddagh brand has been associated with some of the most essential values that the Irish people hold dear, such as love (symbolized by the heart in the Claddagh emblem), friendship (the hands), and loyalty (the crown). You’ll love having these wonderful values close at hand, wherever you choose to mount our bottle opener The word “slainte” from the Irish language translates directly to the English word “health,” but is more commonly used as a synony for “cheers.” Break out this fun piece of trivia as you’re putting our gorgeous bottle opener to use at your next party, and your guests will be impressed Our sturdy, durable Claddagh bottle opener is made from solid brass, giving it a warm, radiant gleam that’s sure to add a touch of class to any space it occupies. And, what’s more, it’s sturdy and durable, meaning it will still be doing its job without issue, many years into the future Our handy bottle opener comes with the correct size and amount of mounting screws included in your purchase, meaning there’s no need to take extra lengths to get your bottle opener installed once it arrives at your home! Simply follow the instructions, and enjoy Thinking of picking this beautiful “Slainte” Claddagh bottle opener up as a souvenir for a loved one? We’ve got you covered! Our wall-mounted bottle opener comes pre-packaged in a lovely Robert Emmet matching box, making for a presentation that’s sure to be both simple and stylish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31DJOjMDKyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Biddy Murphy","source_asin":"B0082BGX78","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882084","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0082BGX78","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0082BGX78","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":882085,"name":"I Read and I Know Things Stemmed Wine Glass with Charm and Presentation Packaging","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31+ExnQo3tL._AC_.jpg","description":"Your glass is engraved with I Read and I Know Things and has whimsical books, bottles, and other graphics engraved 360 degrees around it. It is embellished with a fun and decorative wine charm and arrives in beautiful presentation packaging that is ready for gift giving. The engraving is done with a laser which creates micro fissures in the glass. These micro fissures create a frosted effect that is permanent and dishwasher safe. It wont fade and wont be washed away, chipped, or scratched like other brands. The eye-catching presentation packaging is hand-assembled from wood and ribbon and is a refreshing change to the flimsy plastic that many manufacturers ship in from overseas. If you are giving this glass as a gift, your recipient will appreciate all the fine details. From the beautiful packaging to the fun wine charm to the permanent engraving this gorgeous I Read and I Know Things wine glass is a gift that will be treasured. It is perfect for any occasion including anniversaries, birthdays, housewarmings, engagements, bachelorette parties, graduations, friendship celebrations, secret santa and white elephant exchange, the holiday office party & more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31+ExnQo3tL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Orange Kat","source_asin":"B077MTF47L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882085","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077MTF47L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077MTF47L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
