window.products.push({"id":882183,"name":"Redmond RMC- 5 Quart Electric Pressure Multi Cooker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41sNdSqh40L._AC_.jpg","description":"The RMC-M110 can be both pressure cooker and multicooker. Simply open or close the steam valve and select one of the 55 automatic programs. The main highlight, setting the appliance apart from other pressure cookers available on the market, is the FRY/DEEP FRY mode which enables it to fry and deep fry evenly with an open lid. It also has a POPCORN and GAME mode (for tough or large cuts of poultry and meat). For those of you who want to be able to adjust the time and temperature to meet your needs, the appliance is equipped with the MULTICHIEF mode. For added safety, the device features a multilevel safety protection system against possible overheat or too much pressure. Using the RMC-M110 as a pressure cooker will help you to cook vegetables, meat, fish, soup, and other meals while preserving mineral and vitamin content of the food. The locked position of the steam valve maintains high pressure throughout the whole process. The water starts boiling and producing steam at a temperature higher than 100°C which considerably shortens the time and helps to preserve minerals and vitamins in the food. Cooking under high pressure limits the access of oxygen, preserving the useful properties of the meal. The device may be used as a multicooker to cook under normal pressure with the lid either open or closed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41sNdSqh40L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REDMOND","source_asin":"B015FZ9XMA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015FZ9XMA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015FZ9XMA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":882184,"name":"Saeco TDCM20 Renaissance XX 10-cup Digital Thermal Carafe Drip Coffeemaker, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KARXYA9NL._AC_.jpg","description":"Saeco's Renaissance XX Thermal Coffeemaker takes the drip coffee maker to the level of art through its stylish design element. Not only is the coffeemaker sleek in its look, but it also has advanced features such as its 10-cup thermal insulated stainless steel carafe that keeps coffee hot for hours, its blue LED back light with digital clock face, 24 hour programmable brew time, automatic shut off, pause n' serve which allows that first cup of coffee before the brewing has been completed and a built in compartment to hide cord. With its touch pad design, the Renaissance XX is incredibly easy to operate. 2 brewing buttons on the control panel give the option to either brew immediately or program a brew time up to 24 hours in advance. As well, the XX also features dedicated hour and minute buttons to allow for even greater control in the programming arena. The Renaissance automatically shuts off once brewing is complete. For those of you who anxiously await the completion of that first pot of coffee in the morning, the Renaissance XX can brew up to 10 cups of hot coffee in less than 9 minutes. Although it doesn't feature specific settings for a smaller pot of coffee, you can brew as few as 2 cups of coffee simply by altering the amount of coffee and water you add to the machine. In addition, its stainless steel retains heat and flavor extremely well. The Renaissance XX is equipped to use #4 paper coffee filters in the top-loading filter holder. The holder features an easy-to-use handle that collapses when not in use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KARXYA9NL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saeco","source_asin":"B000EY5NZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EY5NZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EY5NZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
