window.products.push({"id":882291,"name":"Custom Canvas Prints with Your Photos for Kids Aging, Pet/Animal, Wedding, Family - Personalized Canvas Pictures for Wall to Print Framed (16\"x24\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+TgLrh78S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The BOICHEN personalized canvas wall art is a unique way of expressing your love for your family. This unique photo canvas is definitely going to be the centerpiece of your home. Unique design and well package is suitable as a gift to your family, friends, relationships, and someone you cherish. High-quality prints are suitable to decorate your bedroom, dining room, living room, and or kitchen. 🔹MULTIPLE SIZES Multiple sizes optional, you can choose the most suitable size according to the request, canvas professionally stretched on a wooden frame. 🔹PRINT YOUR MOMENTS ON CANVAS The perfect solution for displaying Wedding Photos, Graduation Pictures, Vacation Mementos, Family Photos, Baby Photos, and other noteworthy occasions or as a Unique Personalized Gift for friends and loved ones. 🔹HIGH QUALITY, HIGH DEFINITION PRINTED Latest Latex HP Latex inks printing allows the products to be fade resistant for up to 100 years and paintings stretched on a frame with hooks attached for easy hanging on the wall. You will definitely appreciate the bright and vivid colors of the canvas! 🔹NOTE ☛The technology used for printing your canvas is the last generation, so you will enjoy a clear picture with fine details just like the original There will be a 10% difference from what you see from pc to the actual copy. ☛Just make sure that the image sent to us has a resolution of at least 4 million pixels and that it fits the canvas size that you have chosen, Make sure to upload a high-resolution picture for high-quality print. The low-resolution picture will be low-quality print. 🔹CUSTOMER SERVICE Contact us with any questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+TgLrh78S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOICHEN","source_asin":"B09313YFP7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882291","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09313YFP7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09313YFP7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
