window.products.push({"id":882299,"name":"Mini Bag Sealer, Handheld Heat Vacuum Sealers, 2 in 1 Heat Bag Sealer and Cutter Handheld Portable Chip Bag Sealer for Food Storage","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gLNXEtrXL._AC_.jpg","description":"A good kitchen helper, sealing various bags! This mini bag sealer can seal multiple packaging bags, such as potato chip bags, bread bags, fruit bags ,nut bags, cookie bags, candy bags etc. This mini bag sealer adopt advanced micro heating technology to quickly and evenly seal the bag, resistance to high and low temperature,  effectively seal and block airborne dust, perfectly reseal unused food, Prevent food to be softening and affect the taste, keep foods and snacks fresher and longer,  No need to buy freezer bags, you can reuse the original bags, reducing food waste, bring you a green and healthy life. It's a good choice for Picnic, BBQ, travel or gift giving. EASY TO USE: After installing the battery, press and hold for about 4-8 seconds to start heating,Place the bag to be sealed in the middle,  then slide it along the edge of any bag at a slow and constant speed for airtight seal, For better results, you can repeat it multiple times. MULTIFUNCTION: This hand held bag sealer can also be used as a small cutter for cutting the plastic bags,  a perfect replacement for open-cut scissors or other dangerous tools,  Make your life easier and more convenient. COMPACT AND PORTABLE： The unique hook design bag sealer can be hung and stowed when not in use, do not take up space,  easy to storage and carry, you can take this lightweight sealer anywhere, a necessary for whom like Snacks with the food bag. How to use the 2 in 1 bag sealer ? 1. 2 X AA batteries need to be installed. ( not included) 2. Pressing for about 4-6 seconds before use starts to heat up. 3. Put the bag to be sealed in the middle and slowly pull it at a constant speed.  For better results, the seal can be repeated multiple times. 4. You can switch the other end to open the bag.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gLNXEtrXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Timmenis","source_asin":"B08B6D4HL6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882299","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B6D4HL6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B6D4HL6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
