window.products.push({"id":882320,"name":"Pack of 2 Football Helmet & Rugby 3D Illusion Nightlight Lamp, 7 Colors Changing Lighting Table Desk Lamp for Home Decor - Best Gift for Kids/Friends/","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OrNLnklcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you want to spice up and add a little magic to your décor?  Have you been searching for a safe and reliable night light which inspires your children?  Our 3D Optical Illusion Lamp is your best choice! It is a Cool Gift for kids, adults, families and friends. Features:  - Premium: It is made of acrylic not glass, strong, hard, high toughness, not fragile, will not hurt the child; Laser engraving technology,never fade.  - Style: Fashion and creative. 7 Colors Change. When shut down light, it is still a beautiful decoration and will match your décor.  - Touch button: Press one time, one color light up, press it again, it turns off. Press it thirdly, another color light up.  - Ultra Bright & Eye Safe: Comfortable and pleasant on the eyes, gives out light evenly ensure better eye protection.  - USB Charging & Long Lasting: You can connect it to your home power socket or computer USB port. Low consumption and long lifespan, after charge it full, you can use it for a long time.  - Never Get Hot and Energy-efficient: Very low heat-conductive, will not be hot after long time working. Perfect night light for children. - Occupying Small Space: This 3D Illusion Lamp turned out to be a 2D wire frame lamp which is only a few millimeters wide. Specifications: Wattage: 0.5W Switch Mode: Touch Switch Material: Premium Acrylic + ABS Plastics Base Packing Include: 1X Football Helmet Aclyric plates 1X Rugby Football Aclyric plates1X Touch Switch Button Base 1 X USB Cable(39 in) 1X English Manual NOTE: Acrylic board sided with a protective film, please peel off the protective film carefully before use. If you find it's difficult to peel off,please put it into warm water a few mintues.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OrNLnklcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qunling","source_asin":"B07BRFWTPK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BRFWTPK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BRFWTPK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
