window.products.push({"id":882389,"name":"Gourmia GES580 Electric Spiralizer with 3 Blades Recipe Book, 110V - White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kDWXuKdIL._AC_SL1456_.jpg","description":"Create delicious, healthy meals with Gourmia’s Electric Spiralizer . Spiralizing easily cuts veggies, noodles and fruits into artistic spiral strands of various widths. Great for making delicious, healthy and satisfying alternatives or gourmet garnishes for traditional dishes. Make long cucumber, carrots and radish ribbons for salads, or apple spirals for apple slaw. Includes a Bonus Cookbook for tasty and attractive food ideas. FEATURES • 2-Speeds• Creates delicious spirals with veggies in seconds• 2 spiralizer blades sized for spaghetti & fettuccine noodles • Dispenses noodles directly into large capacity prep bowl• Disassembles easily for fast clean up by hand or in the top rack of dishwasher Includes: Food Pusher and Chute to easily guide vegetables into Spiralizer blade, Spaghetti Blade Cone, Fettuccine Blade Cone, Blade Cone Holder, Prep Bowl, and Spiralizer Base. Easy as 1-2-3: Cut-Secure-Push. Cut both veggie ends, then cut in half. Secure veggie to pusher firmly, then place pusher and veggie in the chute. Push and spiralize in seconds. The Result: Oodles of Noodles. Meals are off the charts when you create delicious recipes using sweet potatoes, cucumbers, carrots, zucchini and more. Gourmet Without Guilt Healthy option instead of traditional pasta, rice and potato dishes, making veggie spirals ideal for raw food, low-carb, gluten free, no wheat and paleo diets. Fuss-Free Cleaning - Dishwasher Safe Top rack, dishwasher-safe parts for fast and easy clean up. Gourmia’s mission is to make everyday cooking easy, healthy and delicious. Our products deliver a higher standard of innovation, performance, and value. Our founders are experts in the world of small appliances and are passionate about providing our customers with dependable, easy to use tools that will make life in the kitchen fun and easy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kDWXuKdIL._AC_SL1456_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gourmia","source_asin":"B01M3VVEN3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882389","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M3VVEN3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M3VVEN3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
