window.products.push({"id":882484,"name":"OSTAR Small Travel Snooze Analog Alarm Clock Quartz Silent Non Ticking AA Battery Operated","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YvROYMqbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Design】A large convenient alarm clock switch is located at the top and it is easy to reach. Easy to use snooze and light buttons are located on the right side of the front. 【Size】Mini enough (2 ¼\" x 2 ¼\" x 1 ¼\"), lightweight (1.68 oz), square features make this travel alarm clock stands out in a crowd. It fits easily into a suitcase even your pocket during your journey. 【Light】Manual-backlight illuminated dial glows evenly across the entire dial for nighttime viewing. Luminous hands will glow for a few minutes after the lights have been turned off. 【Alarm】Ascending four beep alarm volume increases in four stages until the alarm is turned off or the snooze bar is depressed. 【Other】Quiet Sweep movement is run by one AA battery that is not included. Second-hand moves non-ticking, silent alarm clock does not tick for restless sleepers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YvROYMqbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OSTAR","source_asin":"B09F5RHNFN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882484","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F5RHNFN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F5RHNFN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
