window.products.push({"id":882530,"name":"Superior Shredded Memory Foam Pillow with Adjustable Support for Back, Stomach, and Side Sleepers, Removable Zippered Cover made with Cooling and Brea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JuXSaS7RL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"***Grand Down is now Superior brand***  Affordable Luxury Linens These luxurious pillows will lull you to sleep with their premium quality shredded memory foam filling, sturdy enough to offer great back and neck support and soft enough to fall asleep on. They provide back and neck support in all sleep positions, and may assist in the reduction of neck and back pain, snoring, and migraines. These pillows offer the perfect balance between the luxurious comfort of expensive down pillows and the exceptional support of traditional memory foam pillows, making them great for sleeping on, for filling decorative shams, and for knee and leg positioning.  Superior's premium hypoallergenic memory foam filling provides relief to those allergic to down and feather pillows. Our rayon from bamboo and microfiber cover and shredded memory foam fill allow air to circulate for a cooling, breathable pillow. Heritage We have been manufacturing fine linens for over 40 years. We make everything from comforters and mattress toppers, to towels and bath robes, sheets, duvets, pillowcases, and bedskirts, and even area rugs. Our wide range of colors, patterns, and price points ensures that every one of our customers will be able to find something they'll love. We are experts in manufacturing high quality textiles and pride ourselves on only producing the finest products. See what our customers have to say: \"YEP: This will be my new pillow!! THE BEST\" \"No more neck pain, and I'm having sweet dreams.\" \"I'm a stomach sleeper, but I tried it in all sleep positions and it was comfortable, especially on my back.\" \"I am not sure how or why but this pillow seems to be doing the trick and helping me get a more supportive restful night. For that I am grateful.\" \"After trying it, I'll want another one for the other side of the bed\" \"This one is exactly right. This one truly adjusts to the shape of your head and neck. HIGHLY RECOMMENDED\" And try them for yourself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JuXSaS7RL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPERIOR","source_asin":"B012DM45JO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B012DM45JO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B012DM45JO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
