window.products.push({"id":882575,"name":"Hespama 5 Quart Small Storage Bin, Plastic Latch Box with Lid, 6 Packs, R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DNyNS3mxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"External dimensions: 10.55\" x 7.5\" x 6.5\" Internal dimensions: 9\" x 5.3\" x 6.2\" Transparent storage box, easy to identify the inside content Plastic storage bin with latches and built-in handle Capacity is 6 quart, great for storing small items, such as facial masks, handle craft tools, snacks, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DNyNS3mxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hespama","source_asin":"B0BZKJ9YJT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZKJ9YJT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZKJ9YJT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":882576,"name":"Grocery Gripps Hands-Free Shopping Bag Carrier (Plastic and Reusable) - Make Shopping Easier With This Grocery Bag Holder - Ergonomic, Compact, Super ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91dkDJ4xhRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Recently reviewed as, \"Worth the Hype!\" by Harry Connick Jr. and his audience on his NBC talk show! Finally, you can \"get it all in one trip.\" Grocery Gripps is the revolutionary new way to carry your belongings, no matter how much or how far. Grocery Gripps will provide you the assistance you've been searching for when it comes to lugging your grocery bags as well as life's other annoyances - various shopping bags (plastic, tote, or paper with handles), dry cleaning, tailgate supplies, farmers market bags, beach chairs, gym bags, and diaper bags. Anything that allows you to thread it through or around, Grocery Gripps is there for you! The patent pending design combines the best features of the two best ways to carry weight - backpacks and weight lifting straps - into the smallest and most flexible product on the market. The ergonomic design most efficiently and effectively spreads the weight you carry evenly over your strongest body parts, your shoulder or wrist. No matter how much you have to carry or how far you have to go, let Grocery Gripps provide the assistance you need to keep your hands free for life's other needs! From the Manufacturer $10,296 raised with 128 backers. Hands-free and Versatile Grocery Gripps allows you to keep both hands free for keys, buttons, doors, coffee, or even texting. Whether you carry multiple shopping bags (plastic, green totes, or paper with handles), dry cleaning, diaper bags, gym bags, your purse, beach chairs, tailgate supplies, and so much more! Loop your strap through or around and let Grocery Gripps carry it all for you, hands free! Secure Your Items as One Whether you're traveling from the store in your vehicle or riding home on the train or bus, Grocery Gripps will keep your bags together and secure with its Velcro fasteners or naturally by friction. Now you can have the peace of mind to set bags and items in your trunk or on the seat next to you without fear of spilling or damage. When you're ready to transport your bags again, Grocery Gripps allows you to pick them up in one move and go! Keep a \"Gripp\" on your items with the peace of mind you deserve for any setting with Grocery Gripps! Ergonomic Say good-bye to sore and numb fingers! Grocery Gripps’ patent pending design efficiently spreads the weight of life’s annoyances over the larger and stronger muscles that are in your shoulders and wrists. You will never carry the same way again! Compact Our small and flexible design will easily store in any pocket, purse, or glove compartment so you will always have it when you need it. Want to stop at the store on your walk home? Now you can and still carry everything with ease! Incredibly Strong and Durable Built from the highest quality and abrasion resistant nylon webbing, Grocery Gripps can literally hold hundreds of pounds and will last you for years to come. Grocery Gripps can carry it, can you? To provide the simplest, yet most effective and versatile product for carrying life’s annoyances. We spent years designing this awesome tool. It combines the best aspects of backpacks and weight lifting straps, but puts them together in the smallest and strongest product out there. Our goal is to change the way people carry, forever. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Simple, Effective, Hands-free How did you come up with the idea for this product? It had to do with an epic carry in Boston while the founder was attending school. He had to wait for the train and would bend over awkwardly to avoid letting go of the bag handles (because gathering them all back up again is the worst). Long story short, the train took forever, so he walked the three blocks home. By the time he got there, his finger was white and numb. It stayed that way for 4 hours. Fearing permanent nerve damages, he tried every product out there, but realized one common thing - they are all handles replacing handles. He knew there had to be a better way. He joined the army later in life, where he saw a lot of backpacks and weight lifting straps being used by soldiers. That was when lightning struck. He spent the next three years testing and perfecting his design after he moved to Miami. That is when Grocery Gripps was born. What makes your product special? It is the only hands-free, super compact, and versatile way to carry life’s annoyances, even the bulkier ones. Grocery Gripps is the most comfortable way to carry. Period. What has been the best part of your startup experience? Watching people overwhelmingly see the value in your product and design. There is nothing like watching a product you believe in take off, because, as it turns out, others believe in it too.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91dkDJ4xhRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grocery Gripps","source_asin":"B01N7VX9HE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N7VX9HE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N7VX9HE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
