window.products.push({"id":882599,"name":"Russel Wright Pinch 20-Piece Flatware Set, Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31M25Q6CC0L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description With its Russel Wright line, Oneida revisits the stylish aesthetic of one of the 20th centurys most influential American designers. An excellent example of Wrights sensibility, the Pinch flatware pieces are subtly hip with sleek profiles and high-quality craftsmanship. Amazon.com With its Russel Wright line, Oneida revisits the stylish aesthetic of one of the 20th centurys most influential American designers. An excellent example of Wrights sensibility, the Pinch flatware pieces are subtly hip with sleek profiles and high-quality craftsmanship. The knife features a notably broad blade with the Russel Wright signature and the namesake \"pinch\" at the top of the handle. The spoons sport retro-wide bowls. Crafted from 18/10 stainless steel--18 percent chrome for corrosion-resistance and 10 percent nickel for luster--the flatware is durable and lovely, with a mirror finish. This 20-piece set includes 4 place settings, each with a 9-inch place knife, a 7-1/2-inch place fork, a 7-1/2-inch place spoon, 6-5/8-inch salad fork, and 6-1/2-inch teaspoon. All pieces are dishwasher-safe and warranted for 25 years. --Emily Bedard Whats in the Box 4 place settings. Each place setting consists of: 9-inch place knife; 7-1/2-inch place fork; 7-1/2-inch place spoon; 6-5/8-inch salad fork; 6-1/2-inch teaspoon. 20 pieces total. From the Manufacturer The basics for any party of four, whether entertaining or regular dining. Includes 4 each: Salad Fork, Place Fork, Place Knife, Place Spoon, Teaspoon. As casual and sensible as his dinnerware, Russel Wright Pinch Flatware finishes off a perfectly prudent table -- ergonomically correct and progressively retro. 18/10 Stainless Steel. 25-Year Warranty. History and Background Russel Wright (1904-1976) is one of the most influential American designers of the mid-20th Century. Wright's original works are avidly hunted by collectors and his designs in home furnishings have been displayed around the world. Russel Wright Today With the current popularity of retro designs, Russel Wright's tableware pieces are the perfect addition in home decor. His designs are still hip and fun, the same as they were in the 1950s when first introduced. Russel Wright -- the creator of a nation's lifestyle -- recreated. See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31M25Q6CC0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oneida","source_asin":"B00008QUI4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882599","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00008QUI4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00008QUI4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
