window.products.push({"id":882644,"name":"GREENSTELL Bathroom Wall Cabinet with Adjustable Shelf and 2 Hooks, 25.6''x16.1'' Double Doors Medicine Cabinet Wall Mounted with Hanging Bar, Light S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q6aFqKWQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌳Sturdy & Durable-Greenstell wall cabinet is made of Paulownia and industrial-grade steel pipes, which can not only maximize the load-bearing capacity of the cabinet, but also make the product more sturdy and durable. At the same time, The high-quality paulownia wood material we use is LIGHT, wear-resistant, durable, firm, bright and beautiful in color. The metal towel rack gives the product a full industrial style, adding a special touch to your room. 🌳Multipurpose Usage-The small bathroom cabinet is designed with double doors, and the tops of the two doors are equipped with magnetic switches. And there are two hooks on both sides of the cabinet, which are more convenient to use. This wall mounted bathroom cabinet can be used to store towels, shampoo and other toiletries in the bathroom. At the same time Light weight and moderate size 25.6x16.1x6.7'' especially suitable for SMALL bathrooms or Kitchen. 🌳Adjustable Internal Shelf Heights-The shelf inside the bathroom cabinet has three heights(upper, middle and lower)can be adjusted, and the adjustable range is 3 inches. You can adjust it to the level to meet your storage needs of necessities like a shaver, soap, plates, or bottles. A towel bar rod is designed for towels, ties, belts, and so on. 🌳Safe and Reliable-The wall-mounted cabinet is equipped with a water pipe-style hanging rack and tray, which can be used to hang towels and other toiletries, and a fence is added around the tray and the top, which expands the storage space of the cabinet and increases the safety of the product. Effectively prevent items from falling. 🌳Easy to Assemble -The cabinet comes pre-assembled, all you need to do is mount it to the wall with installed mounting brackets. Anchors and screws are included. Structure upgraded, easier assembly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q6aFqKWQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GREENSTELL","source_asin":"B09LLKL2WX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LLKL2WX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LLKL2WX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
