window.products.push({"id":882653,"name":"Chic Home Woodland 6 Piece Reversible Comforter Happy Kids Theme Printed Design Bed in a Bag-Sheet Set Decorative Pillow Sham Included/XL Size, Twin, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.22,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1aGRHwqvrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A fun and colorful comforter set perfect for back to school with everything you need to a transform a child's bedroom. The comforter features a \"Happy Kids\" theme complete with smiling kids on a field of green with woodland details and a two-tone geometric dot and bubble pattern on the reverse. Design coordinated super-soft microfiber sheets, a reversible pillow sham and a reversible printed decorative pillow with piping border are included to complete the look.Specifications: • Size: Twin/Twin XL• Color Scheme: Green, Orange, Teal• Piece Count: 6• Set Includes: • 1pc Reversible Comforter (66” x 90”) • 1pc Reversible Pillow Sham (20” x 26” + 2”) • 1pc Printed \"Happy Kids\" Decorative Pillow with Piping Border (12” x 18”) • 1pc Flat Sheet (55” x 90”) • 1pc Fitted Sheet (39” x 80” + 8” Deep Pocket) • 1pc Pillowcase (21” x 27” + 3\")• Materials: Luxuriously brushed microfiber fabric, hypoallergenic synthetic down alternative fillingFabric and Design: • Silky soft brushed microfiber cotton-feel material• Fun and colorful design with happy kids on a green field on the face and a two-tone geometric dot and bubble pattern on the reverseFeatures:• Luxuriously soft feel for a great night sleep with less tossing and turning • Hypoallergenic alternative down filling is perfect for those allergic to traditional down materials• Built to last with premium fabrics and expert stitchingCare Instructions Dry clean preferred. Machine washable, use front loader machine (or top loader without agitator) to avoid tearing, use cold water on gentle cycle, tumble dry low* Add 2 tennis balls to the dryer to speed up drying and add fluffinessThe digital images we display have the most accurate colo","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1aGRHwqvrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chic Home","source_asin":"B07Q2ZQDJS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q2ZQDJS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q2ZQDJS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
