window.products.push({"id":882763,"name":"KKtiyo Adhesive Shower Caddy Basket Soap Dish Holder Wall Mounted Bathroom Shower Shelf Storage Organizer No Drilling - with Hooks and Towel Bar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619S87KZ7yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KKtiyo shower caddy basket soap dish holder with hooks and towel bar, The Best Organizer for Your Bathroom & Kitchen Accessories Storage! Powerful transparent adhesive, strong adhesion, no need tools, no drilling, free damage wall. Drainage holes design, avoid water accumulation and breeding bacterial. Not only could help organize shampoo, conditioner, shower gel, skincare, towels, kitchen utensil, spices etc, but also ensures the beauty of room with modern and fashion design. There is no doubt that KKtiyo shower shelf soap dish holder is a Space Saver for your bathroom and kitchen! Specification: Size: Shower Caddy Basket: 10.63 x 4.13 x 2.56 inch (27 x 10.5 x 6.5cm)Soap Dish Holder: 5.31 x 3.15 x 0.79 inch (13.5 x 8 x 2cm) Material: High-grade PP Color: Shower Caddy Basket: Beige + Dark GraySoap Dish Holder: White + Light Gray What’s in box: 1 x Shower Caddy Basket4 x Hooks1 x Tower Bar1 x Soap Dish Holder3 x Adhesives Installation Guide: 1. Wipe the area where you want to install and keep it dry.2. Tear off the protective film of adhesive and stick it to the wall.3. Press adhesive firmly to squeeze out all bubbles.4. Hang the shelf. Remove Guide: If you need to mount the shower shelf on another place, please use a hair dryer to heat the adhesive about 3 minutes then tear it off. Kindly Attention: 1. ONLY stick the adhesive on smooth hard surfaces. Please DON’T stick adhesive on painted walls or wallpapers as it will take off your paint or wallpapers.2. Use the product 24 hours later after installation. Adhesive will work better.3. Please note adhesive is NOT reusable.4. If there is any issue with product, please feel free to contact us. We will try our best to solve it and provide 100% satisfactory service!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619S87KZ7yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KKtiyo","source_asin":"B08F7HH9Z8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882763","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F7HH9Z8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F7HH9Z8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":882764,"name":"RanchEx 102426 Hay Hook, D-Handle - The Most Important Tool On The Ranch - 17\" - Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kmEZ8WVWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The RanchEx 17\" D-handle hay hook is one of the most important tools on the farm or ranch. Makes it easy to hook and pick up hay bales; no more looking for strings or fighting tight difficult-to-grasp bale strings. Much faster and easier than bending over to pick up bales by the strings. The D shaped handle allows for a larger range of motion. Has a long handle that is often better suited for taller individuals. It's bright red color is easily visible if dropped in the hay making for a safer environment from lost hooks. 17\" overall length made of durable metal. You can trust RanchEx to provide durability and reliability for all your farm, ranch, and home and garden needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kmEZ8WVWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RanchEx","source_asin":"B06WD4VB79","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882764","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06WD4VB79","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06WD4VB79","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
