window.products.push({"id":882883,"name":"Chameleon Colors Cozy Set - Fuzzy Blanket and Socks Gift Set for Women - Includes Plush Blanket, Fuzzy Pillow, Slipper Socks, and Decorative Christmas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dGzqtMBRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you get stuck during the holiday season not knowing what gifts to buy for the women in your life? Or maybe you have some November and December family birthdays and you're not sure what to get them. Whatever the situation is, women all need one thing: to relax. The Cozy Christmas Gift Set provides all the tools necessary for a moment of comfy and festive self-care. There's no better way to make a woman feel warm and fuzzy than a Cozy Christmas Gift Set! The Cozy Christmas Gift Set includes 1 fuzzy black pillow 1 plush black and white buffalo plaid blanket (5' x 5'),1 pair of red slipper socks (one size fits all), and 1 decorative \"Merry Christmas\" sign (6.25\" x 7\" x 0.25\"). The Cozy Christmas Gift Set comes in an elegant and festive gift tray that's perfect for easy gifting. Whether you're looking for a home spa gift basket for women, get well care package, holiday gift basket, or just a \"thinking of you\" gift, this is the perfect option. All of the items are hand-selected for their quality, and the neutral colors blend easily with most home decor styles. This is the perfect gift for the people you care about most! Whether it's for your 90-year-old grandma or your 10-year-old niece, we know that this will help the women in your life feel special.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dGzqtMBRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chameleon Colors","source_asin":"B08KJ12L8P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882883","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KJ12L8P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KJ12L8P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":882884,"name":"Bicycle Rider Personalized Christmas Ornament - Male - 4\" Tall - Handpainted Resin - Two Wheeler Bike - Free Customization","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JmevKhv1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"He loves his bike and to get out and ride as often as he can. This Christmas ornament is made from cast resin. The material is similar to clay, but is lighter in weight. Then the front side of the ornament is carefully hand painted. The finish is a matt finish. The ornament comes with a ribbon for hanging on the Christmas tree and each item is designed to be personalized to your order. All personalization is done by hand by artists. While lettering style will vary from artists to artist, all lettering is done to our high standards of beauty and legibility, using permanent black ink. Always double check the spelling of each name as once the ornament is personalized we can’t change it! We know you’ll enjoy giving this hand painted and carefully personalized and dated Christmas ornament. It will be enjoyed for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JmevKhv1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calliope Designs","source_asin":"B0194PTLTW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882884","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0194PTLTW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0194PTLTW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
