window.products.push({"id":882889,"name":"Lushrobe Peshtemal Beach Towel Lightweight 100% Cotton Fouta Pool Bath Gym Blanket - 72\" L x 40\" W - Pineapple (Navy Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1B+w9ic4BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM ULTRA SOFT COMFORTABLE FABRIC is woven with the finest 100% cotton from Turkey and designed with twisted fringes for an added flair of design. Towel folds away for travel. STURDY AND DOUBLE-LAYERED – Lushrobe’s Lightweight Peshtemal Turkish Towels come in a variety of different patterns. This reversible towel can be fashionably displayed on either side. It’s extra sturdy and will last you years! VIBRANT AND BRIGHT COLORS - In addition to using this peshtemal towel in spring, summer, fall, or winter, at the beach, gym, bath, spa, outdoors and indoors, there is a large selection of beautiful colors to choose from. Wherever you’re going and whatever you’re doing, this vibrant peshtemal towel will impress everybody. QUICK DRYING AND LIGHTWEIGHT – This towel is not bulky and slow drying like terry towels. If you live in a humid climate, they are perfect as well. Easy to pack for travel and good for any use. MAKES AN IMPRESSIVE GIFT – Get someone the perfect birthday present, housewarming gift, or for a bridal or baby shower. Great for holiday gifting or any special occasions. Your giftee will certainly love your peshtemal towel gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1B+w9ic4BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lushrobe","source_asin":"B01N0ROGAE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882889","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N0ROGAE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N0ROGAE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
