window.products.push({"id":882897,"name":"Bissell SpinWave Pet Robot, 2-in-1 Wet Mop and Dry Robot Vacuum & Pet Multi-Surface Febreze Freshness for Crosswave and Spinwave (64 oz), 22951, 64 Ou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":317.04,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lOPVqW2uL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Bissell SpinWave Pet Robot, 2-in-1 Wet Mop and Dry Robot Vacuum, WiFi Connected with Structured Navigation, 3347BISSELL® SpinWave® Pet wet and dry robotic vacuum gives you two ways to clean in one revolutionary robot. Its two tank system powerfully vacuums or actively mops. So, when used in dry vacuuming mode it collects pet hair, dirt and other debris across multiple surfaces, and when used in wet mopping mode, the mop pads and BISSELL Multi-Surface Formula scrub messes on sealed hard floors. Thanks to the Soft Surface Avoidance Sensor, you don't have to worry about it cleaning surfaces like rugs when in wet mopping mode. Plus, this product doesn't just clean up after pets, it helps save them. BISSELL proudly supports BISSELL Pet Foundation® and its mission to help save homeless pets. When you buy a BISSELL product, you help save pets, too. We’re proud to design products that help make pet messes, odors and pet homelessness disappear.BISSELL Pet Multi-Surface Febreze Freshness for Crosswave and Spinwave (64 oz), 22951, 64 Ounce, 64 Fl OzBISSELL® PET Multi-Surface with Febreze Formula is engineered to work with our innovative CrossWave® machines. It also works in BISSELL® JetScrub™ Pet carpet cleaners with the hard floor attachment. This powerful formula tackles tough messes on hard floors and area rugs*. It removes pet messes and eliminates odors from area rugs and sealed hardwood, ceramic, tile, linoleum, and other hard floors. It leaves behind a fresh, clean Febreze scent and virtually streak-free floors! Plus, it’s safe to use around kids and pets when used as directed. Every purchase of this formula helps save pets. BISSELL proudly supports BISSELL Pet Foundation® and its mission to help save homeless pets. When you buy a BISSELL product, you help save pets, too. We’re proud to design products that help make pet messes, odors and pet homelessness disappear. *Area rugs for CrossWave® machines only. Certain trademarks used under license from The Procter & Gamble Company or its affiliates","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lOPVqW2uL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bissell","source_asin":"B09XMLW3D7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882897","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XMLW3D7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XMLW3D7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
