window.products.push({"id":882917,"name":"In A World Full Of Grandmas Be A Mimi Pumpkin, Sunflower, Plaid, Mothers Day Gift Mug Coffee, Tea, Cocoa 11oz Coffee Cup CM1071","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716VgJRYoQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ MORNING COFFEE CUP: Wake up with your morning coffee and a complement. Start off the day with a dose of caffeine in the AM. Start your day off right with dark coffee and some motivational encouragement printed on either side of the mug, so you can see it and the rest of the world can too. ✅ MAKE SOMEONE SMILE GIFT: Make someone you love smile every time they have a hot beverage. Remind them that you love them, but not in that sappy best dad ever kind of way. Give it to your mom, dad, daughter, sister, boyfriend, girlfriend, husband, wife, or best friend for her birthday, his graduation, or any other occasion where gifts and a happy little chuckle are appropriate. ✅ STURDY CERAMIC: Our classic white ceramic mug is built to stand up to the daily use we know a well-loved mug receives. Plus it's dishwasher and microwave safe because anyone using this mug is too awesome to spend time washing dishes or waiting for water to boil on the stove.✅ SCRATCH RESISTANT PRINT: We use the finest ceramic and our images are imprinted using a Dye Sublimation process that makes the print a part of the mug. ✅ SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: If our inspirational quote or design doesn't make you or someone you know smile (or the mug breaks or is damaged in shipping etc. etc.) we'll refund you. Why? Because you're awesome. 11-ounce Standard-sized Mug with an Awesome Design on Both Sides of it!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716VgJRYoQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0B6SPQ1M7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882917","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6SPQ1M7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6SPQ1M7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":882918,"name":"Magisso Cake Server, Deep Purple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sBd7IUFoL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The Magisso Cake Server is the perfect thing to have on your table for the holidays, parties, and any time you feel like having dessert. The one piece, sleek design gives your kitchen or dining room the look of modern sophistication. You can choose from stylish Stainless Steel Silver or a number of both fun and neutral colors for your home. Serving desserts, especially those with layers is a chore. Your cake almost always winds up on its side with the layers coming apart. Now you can keep the cake upright and intact with this perfect cake server. It holds the piece together while moving it to the plate so that gravity can’t ruin your evening. No more kids complaining that someone got a bigger piece than them and no more people eyeballing each other’s slice at the table. Now everyone gets the same size and shape cut of dessert. Not only does it keep everyone happy at the table, but it makes you look like a professional hostess and server. The Magisso is easier to use than traditional cake servers. It does the cutting and the serving all at once so you cut your hosting time in half. All you need to do is press the cake server through your dessert, squeeze it gently for lifting the piece onto the place. Place it on the plate and release slightly on the server to remove. It’s super simple! Package contains (1) Magisso Cake Server. Suitable for all cakes, and most pastries and other desserts. Dishwasher safe. Finnish designed. Designed for Magisso by Maria Kivijärvi. Available in five different colors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sBd7IUFoL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magisso","source_asin":"B00J7JFW9O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882918","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00J7JFW9O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00J7JFW9O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":882919,"name":"You Got This Tumbler - Personalized Vacuum Insulated Stainless Steel Tumbler with Lid and Straw - New Job Travel Tumbler - Promotion for Coworker - Go","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VqoUnjI2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE ULTIMATE LAST-MINUTE GIFT: Our premium-designed 20 oz seafoam tumbler is the perfect last-minute gift for any ocassion. Made from stainless steel with a vacuum-insulated double wall construction, it keeps drinks cold & hot for hours. Features a wide mouth, sweat-resistant exterior & a convenient rubber straw. Show your loved ones you care! PERFECT PRESENT TO ENCOURAGE AND INSPIRE: Our \"You Got This\" tumbler cup is a memorable present that is great for celebrating life's milestones and special occasions. Whether it's a new job, college graduation, moving or relocating, as a welcome gift or simply to say congratulations, this tumbler cup is sure to make your friends and family feel uplifted and appreciated. PREMIUM SEAFOAM DESIGN: Our stainless steel vacuum-insulated travel mug is great for any adventure! Double-walled design with reusable straw, BPA-free slide-closed lid, non-slip base, and fits most cup holders. TRAVEL WITH EASE: Our stylish coffee travel mug is an ideal gift for grads or those starting a new job. It can also be used to express your encouragement to someone who has fallen on hard times. Its double-walled design keeps coffee hot for hours, and its vacuum insulation ensures your drink stays at the same temperature. Enjoy a warm drink on the go and stay energized! SAY IT WITH SASSY CUPS: Celebrate in style with personalized cups from Sassy Cups! Founded in 2000 in Dallas, TX, our mother-daughter duo has grown into a nationwide sensation. Make every occasion special with a unique eco-friendly tumbler gift that will leave a lasting impression on your friends and family! Sip and celebrate with Sassy Cups!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VqoUnjI2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SassyCups","source_asin":"B07V4784BW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V4784BW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V4784BW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
