window.products.push({"id":882962,"name":"Joynox Cervical Memory Foam Contour Pillow for Neck and Shoulder Pain, Ergonomic Orthopedic Neck Support Sleeping Pillow for Side Sleepers, Back and S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CqbN1CrUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌙ERGONOMIC DESIGN: The cervical pillow features an ergonomic design to help keep the neck bent naturally, support and align your head, neck, shoulder to maintain a good sleeping posture. The specific grooves of the cervical neck pillow on the sides allow your arms to have a good rest for perfect support and avoid numbness. 🌙REDUCE NECK & SHOULDER PAIN: Made of high-quality memory foam contour pillow to help you reduce neck and shoulder pain. It’s is moderately firm and meets your body curve well for promoting blood circulation. You will enjoy a good sleep and refresh your body with our orthopedic pillows. 🌙ADJUSTABLE TWO HEIGHT: The size of the Joynox Ergonomic Pillow is 25.2 x (4.1/4.9)*14.2 inches (L*H*W). Perfect for back and side sleeping. The higher side provides better support for the head and cervical so back sleepers with cervical issues can use the higher side to keep your neck aligned with your body. The other side/stomach sleepers can use the lower side which can help relieve shoulder pressure. 🌙CertiPUR-US PREMIUM MEMORY FOAM: The cervical memory foam pillow core has been certified by CertiPUR-US and OEKO-TEX, odorless and non-toxic, health guarantee. The high-density 5-second slow rebound design of the neck support pillow provides sleeping firm support and maintains its shape for long-term use with a perfect balance between firmness and softness. NOTE: NEVER WASH THE MEMORY FOAM. 🌙REMOVABLE BREATHABLE PILLOWCASE: The pillowcase is made of 100% polyester fiber which is very breathable and skin-friendly to keep the super ergonomic pillow cool for sleeping. The outer cover can be easily removed with a durable zipper and machine washable, easy to clean, and maintain hygiene. All material is chemical-free for improving health. Ideal gift for your family and friends. 🌙QUALITY ASSURANCE: Since everyone's sleep habits are different, their perception of softness and firmness is different; therefore, we cannot guarantee that our products are 100% suitable for everyone. If you feel uncomfortable or uncomfortable during use, please contact our customer service staff in time. We will reply as soon as possible. 🌙NOTICE: If you haven't used a similar pillow before. It is possible for you to experience some discomfort during the FIRST TWO WEEKS while your body is trying to adjust to the correct position. Please be patient and give yourself an adaptation cycle for the cervical pillow. 🌙NOTE: This product is vacuum-compressed; when you receive the product and open the package, please wait patiently for 1-48 hours, and the cervical pillow can return to its original shape.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CqbN1CrUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joynox","source_asin":"B09TSHDPSQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-882962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TSHDPSQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TSHDPSQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
